<!--
    Play-store flavour: deliberately empty.

    The play variant must NOT declare RECEIVE_SMS / READ_SMS. Per Google Play
    policy these permissions are only granted to apps actively registered as
    the default SMS, Phone, or Assistant handler — a UPI announcer does not
    qualify and a Play submission containing them will be rejected.

    The sideload flavour (see app/src/sideload/AndroidManifest.xml) adds the
    SMS permissions and the SmsReceiver registration.
-->
